1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,640
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,800
♪All worldly pursuits are fleeting
dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,360
♪Sorrow fades away, resentment fades
away♪

4
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,880
♪Anger and grudges are but passing
clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,760
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:30,160
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,240
♪This humble monk wanders freely across
the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,440
♪Laughing and fooling around, yet bound
by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,960
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,120
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,240
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit of
wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,600
♪But in the end, all things simply pass
by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,360
♪Better to follow the heart and find
true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,560
♪Don't let worldly troubles bind your
soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,200
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,880
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,440
♪With my worn-out fan in hand, I care
not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,760
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,520
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,920
♪Simple robes and straw sandals beat
fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,080
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple fan
is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,480
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot of
wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,760
♪Wine and meat may pass through me, but
kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,040
♪I cling not to appearances, finding
freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,080
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,560
♪I see life's joys and sorrows in a
single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,160
♪Those who harm the good and abuse their
power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,640
♪Do good and cultivate virtue, and
worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,000
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,760
♪True cultivation lies in a joyful
heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,880
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:53,000
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,708
=The Mad Monk:
Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=

34
00:01:55,709 --> 00:01:57,080
=Episode 2=

35
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,520
So you're just a stinking loach.

36
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,640
Master!

37
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,960
- We got this!
- Yeah!

38
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,400
No, no!

39
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,160
Wait!

40
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,080
This Three-Headed Jiao is dangerous.

41
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,800
Be careful.

42
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,480
Master!

43
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:29,320
Taste my unbeatable stinky shoe!

44
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,720
Tastes good, doesn't it?

45
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,600
Eww!

46
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,600
Arhat!

47
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,440
Whoa!

48
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,800
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

49
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:48,480
Whoa!

50
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,600
(Chen Residence)

51
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,880
Awesome!

52
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,040
(Chen Residence)
That's weird.

53
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,680
Did my powers get stronger?

54
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,880
How'd I beat him that easily?

55
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,880
Your powers didn't get stronger.

56
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,240
He's just too weak.

57
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:07,800
Hey.

58
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,800
Where are your other two heads?

59
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,200
My other two heads?

60
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,000
I only have one.

61
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,680
Aren't you the Three-Headed Jiao?

62
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,720
Why do you only have one head?

63
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,200
Shouldn't you have three?

64
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:25,360
No, I used to be light-fingered.

65
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,760
I was always swiping things.

66
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,840
So they called me Three-Handed Jiao.

67
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:33,760
Oh.

68
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,080
Don't believe me?

69
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,080
Look.

70
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,520
What?

71
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,360
When did you take my gourd?

72
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,160
That's a skill in itself.

73
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:45,440
Yeah.

74
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,800
So Three-Headed Jiao

75
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,600
really means Three-Handed Jiao.

76
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,160
Oh.

77
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,400
All right.

78
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,040
You.

79
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,000
Why did you

80
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,920
take their daughter?

81
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,040
She was my Snake Girl.

82
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,040
Oh.

83
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,520
Back then,

84
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,450
she was the one

85
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:03,680
who showed me what warmth felt like.

86
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,080
So I swore I'd never steal again.

87
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:07,760
Later,

88
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,640
I worked as a porter at the docks.

89
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,520
She did laundry for wealthy families.

90
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,300
After all that,

91
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:14,640
we finally saved 50 taels of silver.

92
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,160
We wanted to make it on our own

93
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,200
and rent a place of our own.

94
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:19,800
Hmm.

95
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,560
But then...

96
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,000
she worked herself too hard.

97
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,240
Oh no.

98
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,800
She fell gravely ill

99
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,360
and passed away.

100
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,320
Oh no.

101
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,080
Later, I found out

102
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,720
she was reborn in the Chen family.

103
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,360
So I wanted to save up 50 taels

104
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,200
and ask for her hand.

105
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,720
But I saved a fox just now

106
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,840
and spent all the money.

107
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,000
- Oh...
- It's all my fault.

108
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,800
If I hadn't spent the money,

109
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,120
none of this would've happened.

110
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,000
At least you know it's your fault.

111
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,160
Holy Monk,

112
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,200
you be the judge.

113
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,480
A wedding
needs traditional betrothal rites.

114
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,600
But this guy?

115
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:02,080
All he gave me was this IOU.

116
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,160
If word gets out,

117
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,840
how can I ever show my face?

118
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,880
Hey, hey!

119
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,120
He's a demon.

120
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,120
Right.

121
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,240
I was rude, Mother-in-law.

122
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,960
Please give me a little more time.

123
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,440
I'll save enough money

124
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,360
and come propose again.

125
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:17,800
Hey!

126
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,040
You're a demon!

127
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,840
You scared my family to death.

128
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:23,800
How about this?

129
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:26,080
Bride price plus emotional damages...

130
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,240
and this...

131
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,240
Make it 500 taels.

132
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,120
Hey!

133
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:32,080
He's a demon!

134
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:33,720
500?

135
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:35,960
I...

136
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:37,760
Fine.

137
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,160
For my Snake Girl,

138
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,320
I'd pay anything.

139
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,120
I'll come back another day.

140
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:43,520
Farewell.

141
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:44,920
(Chen Residence)
Wait!

142
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,360
Alas.

143
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,880
I've had it with you two.

144
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,000
You need to understand.

145
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,200
Snake Girl is human now.

146
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,600
You already hurt her once before.

147
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,480
If you're with her again in this life,

148
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:57,160
- you'll only hurt her again.
- Mm.

149
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,200
But without my her,

150
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,600
how am I supposed to live?

151
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,480
I know exactly how you feel.

152
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:06,920
There was a time

153
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:09,920
I suffered for the woman I loved.

154
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:13,800
- I was heartbroken.
- ♪When we♪

155
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,760
- ♪talk about love...♪
- But...

156
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,680
the past

157
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,680
is the past.

158
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,840
I see romance in your future.

159
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,960
I checked your fortune.

160
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:24,280
Before long,

161
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,480
you'll meet the woman meant for you.

162
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,000
So

163
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,640
- don't waste your energy
- Ah.

164
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,840
- on someone from your past.
- Yeah.

165
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,280
My...

166
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:33,840
My...

167
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:34,560
My one true love?

168
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,160
That's right.

169
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,320
Thank you, Holy Monk.

170
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,280
Thank you.

171
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,600
Hey!

172
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:44,880
Ugh.

173
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,920
What rotten luck.

174
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,520
Money fell right into my lap,

175
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,880
and you blew it.

176
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,920
Don't be upset.

177
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,800
I also read your younger daughter's

178
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,840
fortune.

179
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:57,120
She's destined for great wealth.

180
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,880
One day,

181
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,080
she'll make you rich too.

182
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:00,960
Really?

183
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:01,920
That's wonderful!

184
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,640
Well then,

185
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:05,600
I'd say your problem is solved.

186
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,360
Thank you, Holy Monk.

187
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,040
No need.

188
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:10,520
Oh, right.

189
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,480
Remember last time

190
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:13,200
at the Liu family, subduing a demon?

191
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,960
- Oh.
- They were so generous.

192
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,960
After we subdued it,

193
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,880
they insisted on giving us 200 taels.

194
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,080
I said no,

195
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,600
- but they insisted.
- Right.

196
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,520
Can you believe that?

197
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,320
Seriously.

198
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,880
I heard about that.

199
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,800
But you're a man of principle.

200
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,240
You didn't take a cent.

201
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,800
That's truly admirable.

202
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,680
Exactly.

203
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,160
It's just

204
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,720
that times are hard lately.

205
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,560
At Lingyin Temple,

206
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,240
we hardly get any worshippers.

207
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,840
Ticket sales are down too.

208
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,920
And we all

209
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,080
still have to eat.

210
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,320
- Right.
- So...

211
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,640
Oh!

212
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,120
Ah.

213
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:45,880
My mistake.

214
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:46,400
Meiniang,

215
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,000
get the Holy Monk

216
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,120
a basket of steamed buns.

217
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:49,840
Yes.

218
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,200
Huh?

219
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,120
Steamed buns?

220
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:53,800
Thank you.

221
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,880
Piaopiao, go with her for the buns.

222
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,440
(Chen Residence)
Thank you, Mrs. Chen.

223
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,040
Thank your whole family for me.

224
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,320
Ugh.

225
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,320
See?

226
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,880
People surnamed Chen

227
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,120
are so stingy.

228
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,840
That's not it, Holy Monk.

229
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:11,700
Ever since Mr. Huang

230
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,040
came to Lin'an City,

231
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,400
he's driven market prices down,

232
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,640
then bought goods dirt cheap.

233
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,280
Horrible.

234
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,400
Now he controls

235
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,640
most goods on the market.

236
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,480
People can barely make ends meet.

237
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,300
Then where do you get

238
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:24,560
money for wine and meat?

239
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,600
Piaopiao and I perform every night.

240
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,720
Perform?

241
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,400
That must be rough.

242
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:33,640
Now you know money's hard to earn.

243
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:36,080
Give me back the overseer position.

244
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,440
Hmph.

245
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,560
(Chen Residence)
It's just 500 taels.

246
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:40,440
You think that'll stump me?

247
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,040
Let's go.

248
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,040
(Chen Residence)
Do you know how to make money?

249
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:44,440
Of course.

250
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,680
You two keep performing.

251
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,280
We'll

252
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,600
haul cargo at the docks.

253
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,400
Sounds good?

254
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,280
What do you mean, "we"?

255
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:49,800
You go.

256
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:51,040
We're going back to Lingyin Temple.

257
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,280
We're heading back.

258
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,040
Bye.

259
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,240
Who will my one true love be?

260
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,040
Where is she?

261
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,000
My savior!

262
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,320
Who are you?

263
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:11,680
I'm the little fox you just saved.

264
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,600
I'm Su Ling'er.

265
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,840
Oh.

266
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,440
It's you.

267
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,600
Give me my money back.

268
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,240
Give it back!

269
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,120
I don't have any money.

270
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,120
But...

271
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,960
I heard you talking to that monk.

272
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,360
Since you saved me,

273
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,000
I'm willing to be

274
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,760
the woman he said was meant for you

275
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:31,640
and marry you.

276
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:32,560
You?

277
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,320
Yes.

278
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,680
Don't be ridiculous.

279
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,000
I'm a jiao. I hatch from eggs.

280
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,560
Foxes give birth to live young.

281
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,960
We're not even the same species.

282
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,000
You're wasting my time.

283
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,600
Move.

284
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:44,880
Hmph.

285
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,520
Mother!

286
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,600
Since that darn monk came to Lin'an,

287
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:00,240
the demons nearby don't dare eat people.

288
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,240
Hunters have also wiped out

289
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,400
the birds and beasts in the woods.

290
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,900
I haven't eaten

291
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:10,760
in dozens of days.

292
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,160
At this rate,

293
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,000
I'll starve to death.

294
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,160
Mother!

295
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,880
I don't have a choice.

296
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,320
It's your unlucky day.

297
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,960
I'll eat first and worry later.

298
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,800
When will my one true love

299
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,720
finally show up?

300
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:49,400
(Does love really happen this fast?)

301
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,960
She's gorgeous.

302
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,560
And she's a snake demon.

303
00:11:00,040 --> 00:11:00,720
Snake Girl!

304
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:03,880
Let go of me!

305
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:04,960
Let go!

306
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:08,400
Don't be afraid.

307
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,160
It's okay.

308
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:09,840
Hmph.

309
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,400
The Holy Monk was right.

310
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,880
You're my one true love.

311
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,760
That darn monk!

312
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,560
And who are you?

313
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,400
I am the Three-Headed Jiao King.

314
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,040
(The Jiao King?)

315
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,520
(No wonder he's so powerful.)

316
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,320
(I have nowhere to go right now.)

317
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,080
(If I can win him over,)

318
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,280
(I'll be set for life.)

319
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,640
We shouldn't talk here.

320
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:43,080
Since the monk says we're meant to be,

321
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,160
why don't you

322
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,280
take me home

323
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,960
so we can talk in private?

324
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:48,960
Sure.

325
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:49,800
Sure.

326
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:50,800
After you.

327
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,960
This is your home?

328
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,080
It may be shabby,

329
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,760
but it's better than a cave.

330
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,600
Caves have too much yin energy.

331
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,400
Stay too long,

332
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,600
and your back and neck start aching.

333
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:14,840
(He must be keeping a low profile.)

334
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,800
(I bet it's amazing inside.)

335
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,360
I'm getting hungry.

336
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,440
May I

337
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,640
go inside and get something to eat?

338
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,160
After you.

339
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,680
It's my first time at your place,

340
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:37,080
and this is what you serve me?

341
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,800
To be honest,

342
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,680
money's been tight lately.

343
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,160
This is the best food I can offer.

344
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,560
If you don't want it,

345
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,464
I'll make you

346
00:12:46,465 --> 00:12:47,520
something better later.

347
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:48,720
Wait.

348
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,240
You're the Jiao King.

349
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,300
How can you live

350
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:55,880
worse than some lowly demon?

351
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:59,520
I spent 5,000 years in seclusion.

352
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,560
I'm used to a simple life.

353
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,360
5,000 years?

354
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:04,320
Ah.

355
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,080
(Mother once told me)

356
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,720
(a 5,000-year-old jiao can face
a tribulation and become a true dragon.)

357
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:11,000
(No one in the Three Realms could stand
against him.)

358
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,000
(If I can make him serve me,)

359
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:16,320
(I could rule the Three Realms.)

360
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,520
My dear.

361
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,600
My dear,

362
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,960
after 5,000 years of cultivation,

363
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:29,360
why not face the tribulation
and become a true dragon?

364
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,080
The tribulation is no joke.

365
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,320
Many died in lightning tribulations.

366
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,880
Rather than risk the tribulation,

367
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:41,440
I'd rather live peacefully with you.

368
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,880
Oh...

369
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:47,840
My dear,

370
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:51,560
I have a strange illness.

371
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,920
A master once told me

372
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:57,760
I'd marry a true dragon one day.

373
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,120
Only a true dragon's blood

374
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:02,160
can cure it.

375
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,000
True dragon's blood?

376
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,680
If it's really that dangerous,

377
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:13,040
I can't let you risk your life for me.

378
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,920
If I can die by your side,

379
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:19,120
I'll have no regrets.

380
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:23,400
No.

381
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:24,750
I won't let

382
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,200
Snake Girl's fate repeat.

383
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:27,560
No matter the danger,

384
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,280
I won't let you leave me.

385
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:34,880
My dear,

386
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,920
I know a way

387
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,440
to help you survive the tribulation.

388
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,440
What?

389
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,480
My savior is Three-Headed Jiao?

390
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,680
That awful snake demon!

391
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,680
She knows the tribulation is dangerous,

392
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,000
but still sends him into danger.

393
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,480
I have to protect him.

394
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,040
Got money? Toss us some!

395
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,280
No money? Cheer us on!

396
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:01,160
Thank you!

397
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,600
Thank you!

398
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,400
Hey!

399
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:07,840
Hurry up!

400
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,960
Darn you, Daoji!

401
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:13,360
What?

402
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,680
Fine if you want to haul cargo,

403
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:15,880
but why drag us into it?

404
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,400
And you picked the lightest load!

405
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,080
Have...

406
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,200
Have you no shame?

407
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,240
So what?

408
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,160
I'm the overseer now.

409
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,320
So why should I feel bad?

410
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,560
But you keep

411
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,960
mouthing off.

412
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,080
Say one more word,

413
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,040
and I'll kick you out of Lingyin Temple.

414
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,000
Take this!

415
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,200
Master!

416
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:31,960
Need help?

417
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,520
Hold this!

418
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,120
Hey!

419
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,160
Fine, fine.

420
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,600
You win.

421
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,120
Whoa!

422
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,080
It's bustling!

423
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,760
(He's General Store)

424
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,120
Master.

425
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:06,880
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

426
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:10,080
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

427
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:13,880
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

428
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:16,960
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

429
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:20,920
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

430
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:24,120
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

431
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:27,680
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

432
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:37,600
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

433
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:40,840
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

434
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:44,160
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

435
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,840
♪I thought of the Arhat who subdued the
tiger♪

436
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,760
♪And there he was, right by my side, oh
my♪

437
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,320
♪I left my wife behind♪

438
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,920
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

439
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:54,760
♪Living a life of hiding here and
running there♪

440
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,880
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

441
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:58,000
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

442
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,680
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

443
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,560
♪Waiter, bring me a plate of chicken
wings♪

444
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:04,920
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

445
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:08,200
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

446
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:11,320
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

447
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:14,680
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

448
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:18,360
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

449
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:21,720
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

450
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:24,800
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

451
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:28,440
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

452
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:31,880
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

453
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:35,440
♪You chase fame and fight over fortune
and fate♪

454
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:38,920
♪You're just wasting your time♪

455
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,880
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

456
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,560
♪And I just laugh happily♪

457
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:46,960
♪Wishing joy and happiness for all in
this world♪

458
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:59,240
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

459
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:02,640
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

